dist/
node_modules/
# Build outputs: the packaged extension, and the engine staged into it during packaging.
*.vsix
# Anchored. Unanchored, `cli/` matches a directory of that name at any depth — including
# `src/cli/`, which is hand-written source. Those three files predate the rule so git keeps
# them in a clone, but every route that honours .gitignore dropped them: `npm pack` shipped
# zero of them, and a build from the resulting tree fails to resolve ./cli/client.ts.
/cli/
